SampleKuproNode.description:
Where a sampled item lands under one fold. string? SampleKuproNode.Key is the Kupro key it would get, if its number is free.
string? SampleKuproNode.OldParent is the source parent it moves away from (kept as a `relates` relation);
string? SampleKuproNode.LabelOf is the folded top-level item whose name becomes its label.
